            "review_title": "Review at OM Eatery - Vegetarian & Vegan Food",
            "review_text": "kane\n1 contribution\n0\nAmazing Vegetarian Experience at OM Eatery!\nOct 2024 • Friends\nI was pleasantly surprised by OM Eatery’s creative take on vegetarian Vietnamese fusion. The dishes were fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. I loved the tofu Banh Mi, but the vegan pho stole the show – it’s the best I’ve had in Vietnam! The staff was warm and welcoming, and the ambiance made it a relaxing spot to enjoy a meal. Highly recommend this place for anyone seeking healthy and delicious vegetarian options!\nRead more\nWritten October 4, 2024",
